    "name": "8K Training: Novice",
    "author": "Hal Higdon",
    "version": "1.0",
    "created_at": null,
    "description": "HOW MUCH DO YOU NEED TO TRAIN to be able to run your first 8K? Some individuals who possess a reasonably good level of fitness (because they bicycle or swim or participate in other sports) could probably go out and run 5-6 miles on very little training. They might be sore the week after a ... Continue reading \"Novice\"",
